#heading(numbering: none)[Abstract]

#text(lang: "en")[This document provides a Typst-based template for BSc and MSc theses written by students of the Faculty of Electrical Engineering and Informatics at the Budapest University of Technology and Economics. It can also be used for Scientific Students' Association (TDK) papers and doctoral dissertations. The use of this template is optional. A Typst compiler, either online or installed locally, is required to compile the template.]
